@Atlas.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5179

### Health check
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain

### Reference data for the form dropdowns
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reference
Accept: application/json

### Commit capital — VALID (expects approved: true)
POST {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commitments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fundId": "PF-APAC-CREDIT",
  "coInvestmentId": "CI-ROOT",
  "dealId": "DEAL-PE-NA-02",
  "amount": 10000000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "assetClass": "PrivateEquity",
  "region": "NorthAmerica",
  "liquidity": "Illiquid",
  "commitmentDate": "2026-09-01",
  "requestedBy": "pm.alice"
}

### Commit capital — FAILING (expects approved: false; COINVEST_NO_HEADROOM + APPETITE_BREACH)
POST {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commitments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fundId": "PF-APAC-CREDIT",
  "coInvestmentId": "CI-SLEEVE-PC",
  "dealId": "DEAL-PC-EMEA-01",
  "amount": 25000000,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "assetClass": "PrivateCredit",
  "region": "Emea",
  "liquidity": "Illiquid",
  "commitmentDate": "2026-07-01",
  "requestedBy": "pm.bob"
}

### i18n — available locales (drop a JSON file in i18n/ to add one, no rebuild)
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/locales
Accept: application/json

### i18n — German entries (missing keys fall back to en)
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/de
Accept: application/json

### i18n — French entries (missing keys fall back to en)
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/fr
Accept: application/json

### i18n — locale configuration (default + enabled/fallback per locale)
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/config
Accept: application/json

### i18n — set one German entry (If-Match guards against lost updates; 409 when stale)
PUT {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/de/entries/hier.back
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{ "value": "Zurück", "actor": "pm.alice", "reason": "wording" }

### i18n — German version history, newest first
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/de/versions
Accept: application/json

### i18n — restore version 1 as a NEW version (history is never rewritten)
POST {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/de/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toVersion": 1, "actor": "pm.alice", "reason": "revert wording" }

### i18n — audit trail, newest first
GET {{Atlas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/i18n/audit?locale=de&limit=20
Accept: application/json
